<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>18 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>15 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>10 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid),</p>
<p>Luis Enrique Martinez (Barcelona)</p>
<p>9 - Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid), Christopher Ohen (Compostela)</p>
<p>8 - Alfonso Perez (Betis), Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna),</p>
<p>Darko Kovacevic (Real Sociedad), Kiko Narvaez</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid)</p>
</text>
